\&Select another branch by passing in the branch name
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-c, \-\-commit <string>\fR
\&Select another commit by passing in the commit SHA, default is the last commit
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-n, \-\-no\-browser\fR
\&Print destination URL instead of opening the browser
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-r, \-\-releases\fR
\&Open repository releases
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-R, \-\-repo <string>\fR
\&Select another repository using the OWNER/REPO format
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-s, \-\-settings\fR
